    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42120" root="وعد" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعِدٌ</span></b>  signifies <i>A covenant,</i> or <i>compact.</i> So,
accord. to Mujáhid, in ch. xx. vv. 89 and 90,
of the Kur-án. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعِدٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعِدَةٌ</span>: see 1,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعْدٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيعَادٌ</span>.

